{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b70624a92f7da9c66a5be2d49bf9a6f6bdedce6bb1ba5d59a112e68f0df38894", "ja": "（Cleaskyのリバイバル公演が終わった。爽やかな\nふたりの歌声に、会場は大盛り上がりだったな）", "zh": "（Cleasky的复刻公演结束了。两人清爽的歌声让会场的气氛热烈到了极点。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "968cc93d51497c4f4ef667d02316e131727a4590d576f8ca99c7ea1611fc8803", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\nとっても、楽しいステージでしたよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您辛苦啦～\n舞台真的超级开心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2221dfb25516bedb79628555b385208176698a2c2e519342274c7afa6b8a72d3", "ja": "ああ、本当にいい公演だったな！\nふたりの楽しい気持ちが伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "啊，确实是一场很棒的公演！\n能感受到你们两个人的快乐心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "946c1a82b6324a4ac102330428c4520c5f520cb0ef7847be0c2a102272fafa65", "ja": "お～、それはよかったです～。\nそれなら、叶うかもしれませんな～。", "zh": "哦～那真是太好了～。\n这样一来，说不定就能实现了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1004_p", "source_sha256": "17c2f80438250065af0a7463537f457772f4052dcf472dfa135e28316596ca44", "ja": "ん？　叶うって、何がだ？", "zh": "嗯？能实现是指，什么事要实现了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee0692b163789dc6830fee75d4e68e0e9cb02fb26289424bea33e12841e62f25", "ja": "さっき、エレナさんと話してたんですよ～。\nみんなが、私たちの歌を聞いて……。", "zh": "刚才我在和艾蕾娜小姐聊天哦～  \n要是大家听了我们的歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "b82af4abe3bed500bafd9b25e73d0741809ef02bb2a9b029f0a8c331a4b95fb1", "ja": "同じように、一緒に青春を過ごしたいと\n思ってくれたらいいですね～、って。", "zh": "要是大家也能这么觉得，想和我们一起度过\n这段青春时光，那就太好了呢～，我们是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "6d07f34c8053c7d50bedf0ec5bef80db39d550b1b8818cec79fa64a14770d040", "ja": "私たちは今、とっても楽しいので～。\nこの楽しさを、みなさんにも感じてもらえたらと～。", "zh": "我们现在真的玩得很开心哦～。\n要是大家也能感受到这份快乐就好了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1008_p", "source_sha256": "50b497377ae7fb4a25d16cc39462a4cddc1995e183b5ddcda22dbc5ccff97c93", "ja": "はは、そうか。その希望は、\n今日の公演で叶ったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "哈哈，是吗？那个愿望，\n今天的公演不是已经实现了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bfbc7f4cfa573b1be921fd7e9fbdea9a30d0b3dc5b53c8ef1ccc26e9800b94cf", "ja": "お客さん達みんな、すごく楽しそうだったからな！", "zh": "因为所有客人看起来都特别开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "1fac8af389e92e5d00418f6cc991e118e96c88075a4a4c4df320b53ef770f506", "ja": "お～、なるほど～……。\nつまり、公演は大成功、ということですな～。", "zh": "哦～原来如此～……\n也就是说，公演大获成功了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "23d50f1c1677cc8cabb94cf4c48aa66a999ff659f4f60c1d4464a2de57c76676", "ja": "{$P$}さん、教えてくれて\nありがとうございます～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你告诉我～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dc542b03d389359173b61c9906a37fc2b3ab063ee76182b48f14b53f99d2e6b3", "ja": "こちらこそ。ふたりのおかげで、\n今日もいい思い出になったよ。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。多亏了你们两位，今天也留下了美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "d87211798e28995a9a0b6618b275587ad3d7e9f6d730b4ec7a4599bff924bd37", "ja": "それは何よりですな～。これからも、\n私たちと、たくさん青春していきましょうね～。", "zh": "那就再好不过了～今后也和我们一起，尽情享受青春吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0283_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "aab45482c5d87ddacff9cdfba676f14fc7f92871cb7f5fda9a7bb34a0ad28623", "ja": "楽しいことばかりではないかもしれませんけど……\nそれもまた青春、ですからね～。ふふふ♪", "zh": "也许不会总是开心的事……\n但那也是青春的一部分呢～。呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
